{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101370","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110137001:1":{"text":"아센 사막은 정말 무섭네요! 상록수 학회에 가입한 뒤로 이렇게 위험한 곳엔 한 번도 와본 적이 없었는데...","source_cn":"荒角沙漠好可怕！加入冬青学会后，我还从没来过这么危险的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABED7BD06A32B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110137002:1":{"text":"선배의 허튼소리를 듣고 이 과제에 합류한 걸 후회하고 있어요.","source_cn":"我已经后悔听了前辈的鬼话，加入这个课题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417D3CBDE1622CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110137003:1":{"text":"크, 큰일이네. 너무 큰 소리로 말한 것 같아요! 선배가 알면 절 혼내실 텐데!","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110137003":{"text":"크, 큰일이네. 너무 큰 소리로 말한 것 같아요! 선배가 알면 절 혼내실 텐데!","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110137004:1":{"text":"엥? 선배...! 선배님 어디 계세요! 왜 저만 내버려두고 가신 거예요!","source_cn":"诶？前辈——！前辈你在哪里！为什么留下我一个人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CC06887744BC17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110137005:1":{"text":"이곳에 오기 전에 사막에선 길을 잃기 쉽다고 들었는데... 서, 설마 길을 잃은 걸까요?","source_cn":"来之前我就听说，这片沙漠特别容易迷路！难道、难道前辈迷路了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB439283D5409FFE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110137006:1":{"text":"얼른 가서 찾아봐야겠어요! 설마 사막에 또 다른 거미는 없겠죠?","source_cn":"不行，我要去找前辈！这片沙漠里应该没有别的蜘蛛了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32DBD3640B8D9B35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110137007:1":{"text":"거미도 그렇지만, 다른 야수도 많을 텐데.","source_cn":"蜘蛛有可能，别的野兽也不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2210C56561FE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110137008:1":{"text":"흑... 사실 전 거미를 제일 무서워해요...","source_cn":"呃！腿软了！诸位可能看不出来，不过我其实最怕蜘蛛了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F895A4C2131C182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110137008":{"text":"흑... 사실 전 거미를 제일 무서워해요...","source_cn":"呃！腿软了！诸位可能看不出来，不过我其实最怕蜘蛛了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F895A4C2131C182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110137009:1":{"text":"걱정할 거 없어! 선배를 찾기 전까지 우리가 보호해 줄게!","source_cn":"看出来了，不过你别担心！我们会保护着你，去找到你的前辈的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9030F5CFDDF57FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110137011:1":{"text":"사람을 찾는 일은 우리에게 맡겨. 괜찮아, 석양 전투장으로 가는 길은 멀지 않으니까, 제때 도착할 수 있어!","source_cn":"找人的事就包在我们身上——没关系，去残阳武斗场的路不远...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x060836E1D28A6195","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사람을 찾는 일은 우리에게 맡겨. 괜찮아, 석양 전투장으로 가는 길은 멀지 않으니까, 제때 도착할 수 있어!","female":"사람을 찾는 일은 우리에게 맡겨. 괜찮아, 석양 전투장으로 가는 길은 멀지 않으니까, 제때 도착할 수 있어!","variant_male_record_index":"123011","variant_female_record_index":"123012","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110137012:1":{"text":"아르사, 너 또 쓸데없는 오지랖을... 됐어, 속전속결로 하자고.","source_cn":"阿尔萨，你又在把事情往身上揽——算了。速战速决吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4F05DBDEB7967F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110137013:1":{"text":"안 그럼, 그냥 내버려 두자는 거야?","source_cn":"我们难道能放着他不管吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE52F216BCB423F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110137014:1":{"text":"안 될 건 또 뭐야?","source_cn":"我看不出来为什么不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4FF9464B5D349AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110137015:1":{"text":"난 어려운 상황에 처한 사람을 보면 그냥 두고 볼 수가 없다고!","source_cn":"我可不能眼睁睁地看着，有人在乌尔氏族的附近出事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B93DAB3CFB1F552","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110137016:1":{"text":"...맘대로 해. 저기 가서 찾아보자.","source_cn":"……随你，向前找找吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B32A4AC3439FE6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"그래 보여","source_cn":"看出来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x56F43537B42302D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래 보여","female":"그래 보여","variant_male_record_index":"63782","variant_female_record_index":"63783","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110137010:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그건 내가 하려던 말인데? 통했네 우리?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC9798E7E7334E808","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그건 내가 하려던 말인데? 통했네 우리?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그건 내가 하려던 말인데? 통했네 우리?","variant_male_record_index":"123009","variant_female_record_index":"123010","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"도와줄게","source_cn":"我们带着你找人吧","status":"matched_run